    Even-degree iterated residues make all paths to deeper intersections identical. By Lemma 3 and projection formula,
  $ \( pi_R \)_(*) pi_R^(*) \( L \|_(C_Z) \) = \( L \|_(C_Z) \) $
  for any ambient Cartier line $L$ under consideration. The section descends uniquely to all of $C_Z$.
