  #[#set math.equation(numbering: n => "(12.13)")
   $ macron(p)^m mapsto sum_(j \, i) J_(j i)^(\#) tilde(e)_i \( u^(- m) \) ⊗ partial_(w_j) $ <eq:global-symbol-local>]
