    In the definition of $e_i \( x \)$, the factor $x$ multiplies outside the derivation.
    Hence no derivative of $lambda$ occurs. Naturality and the chain rule (12.2) transform the downstairs column
    of $e_i$’s by $lambda^m A_t$.
