    Consequently, for the pulled columns and Jacobians,
  #[#set math.equation(numbering: n => "(12.15)")
   $ tilde(e)' & = frac(det B_w, det A_t) lambda^m A_t tilde(e) \, & J' & = A_t J B_w^(- 1) \,\
\( J' \)^(\#) & = frac(det A_t, det B_w) thin B_w J^(\#) A_t^(- 1) \, & \( J' \)^(\#) tilde(e)' & =
  lambda^m B_w J^(\#) tilde(e) . $ <eq:symbol-transition-one>]
